Basket Rush is an original eight-bar, 160 BPM arcade music loop.
Its melody, arrangement, and instrument sounds were composed and synthesized
procedurally with Python, NumPy, and SciPy. No external recordings or samples
were used. This asset preserves the selected chaotic preview's composition
and mix, encoded as Ogg Vorbis for the game.

AI usage disclosure: The composition and synthesis code were created with
OpenAI Codex assistance at the user's request.
